            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakati huo, mfalme Merodak-baladani mwana wa Baladani, mfalme wa Babuloni, aliposikia kwamba Hezekia alikuwa ameugua na sasa amepona, alimtumia ujumbe pamoja na zawadi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.39.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.39.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 39:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Basi, Hezekia aliwakaribisha na kuwaonesha nyumba ya hazina: Fedha, dhahabu, viungo vya kukolezea chakula, mafuta ya thamani, vifaa vyake vyote vya kijeshi na vitu vyote vilivyokuwamo katika bohari zake. Hakuna chochote katika ikulu yake au katika nchi yake ambacho hakuwaonesha.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.39.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.39.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 39:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.39.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.39.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 39:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndipo nabii Isaya alipokwenda kwa mfalme Hezekia na kumwuliza, “Watu hawa wamesema nini? Na, wamekujia kutoka wapi?” Naye Hezekia akamjibu “Wamenijia kutoka nchi ya mbali, huko Babuloni.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.39.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.39.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 39:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Halafu Isaya akamwuliza, “Wameona nini katika ikulu yako?” Hezekia akamjibu, “Wameona yote yaliyomo katika ikulu yangu. Hakuna chochote katika bohari zangu ambacho sikuwaonesha.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.39.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.39.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 39:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.39.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.39.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 39:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndipo Isaya akamwambia Hezekia, “Sikia neno la Mwenyezi-Mungu wa majeshi: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.39.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.39.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 39:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tazama, siku zinakuja ambapo vyote vilivyomo nyumbani mwako na vitu vyote walivyokusanya wazee wako hadi leo, vitapelekwa mpaka Babuloni. Hakuna kitu chochote kitakachobaki; ndivyo asemavyo Mwenyezi-Mungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.39.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.39.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 39:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39:7 Taz Dan 1:1--7:2; 2Fal 24:10-16; 2Nya 36:10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Tena baadhi ya watoto wako mwenyewe wa kiume watapelekwa mateka nao watakuwa matowashi katika ikulu ya mfalme wa Babuloni.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.39.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.39.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 39:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye Hezekia akamwambia Isaya, “Neno la Mwenyezi-Mungu ulilosema ni sawa.” Alisema hivyo kwani alifikiri, “Kutakuwa na amani na usalama muda wote niishipo.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.39.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.39.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
